#25200
&08The Nine Hells&00 - Plane of Dis~
You have successfully passed through the Plane of Avernus. Congratulations!
You must be very powerful (and lucky) beings to have made it this far.
Going further will be insane..so recall now.
~
252 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#25201
The portal platform~
   You are on a circular stone plaform, jutting out over the northwestern edge
of a very tall stone tower.  To the north and west, you can see an endless
expanse of cracked and torn landscape of red rock.  Avove, the sky churns and
boils a murky green, with streaks of lightning lashing out wildly.  A strong
wind rushes past you and threatens to push you towards and over the edge.  
Beneath your feet, the platform is unadorned stone, save for a faded red eye
painted in the very center.    
~
