#25202
Outside the tower~
   You are outside a large stone tower.  Behind you is a stone crenelation that
looks nice and solid to stand on.  Beneath you, however is air.  Much, much
further beneath you is hard, unforgiving rock.  As you take all this in, you
notice that the rock is getting much closer.  This won't end well.    
~
