#25203
The tower crenelations~
   You are on a walkway near the top of a stone tower.  To the southeast, the
tower rises another twelve feet above you, topped by an obsidian sphere about a
foot wide from which most of the violent weather flows.  The walkway continues
around the tower to the east and south, while to the northeast a small flight
of stairs leads up to a precarious looking platform.  The edge of the walkway
is crenelated, with enough room for you to slip through the gaps.    
~
