#25299
A dark cell~
You are in a cramped little cell, with stone walls on every side.  To the
north, a heavy iron door takes up most of the wall.  The floor is uneven
and covered with a thick layer of dirt and filth, accumulated over millenia
from prisoners left in here to die.  The south wall has a set of bolts set
into it, from which hang an empty set of manacles.
